        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本輪有 %lld 次節點設定轉換失敗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "额外复核 %lld 次；双目标失败且有成功对照的节点 %lld 个，暂缓自动选择 5 分钟，手动复测成功可立即恢复": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld additional checks; %lld nodes failed both targets with a successful control. Automatic selection is paused for 5 minutes; a successful manual retest restores eligibility."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "追加確認 %1$lld 回；対照成功がある状態で両対象に失敗したノード %2$lld 件は5分間自動選択から除外されます（手動再測定成功で即時復帰）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "額外複核 %1$lld 次；雙目標失敗且有成功對照的節點 %2$lld 個，暫緩自動選擇 5 分鐘，手動複測成功可立即恢復"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本轮暂缓探测 %lld 个冷却中的候选": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skipped %lld candidates in cooldown this round"
