    "「实收 / 源」不相等说明按内存预算抽样过；未注入的部分仍由内置 geosite:cn / geoip:cn 兜底。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When loaded/source counts differ, entries were sampled to stay within the memory budget; remaining entries are still covered by built-in geosite:cn and geoip:cn."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「取得数 / 元数」が異なる場合はメモリ上限に合わせてサンプリングされています。未注入分も組み込み geosite:cn / geoip:cn で補完されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「實收 / 來源」不相等說明已依記憶體預算抽樣；未注入的部分仍由內建 geosite:cn / geoip:cn 兜底。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
